{
 "voice": "af_heart",
 "speed": 1.1,
 "duration": 185.911,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This is a full tour of every named place on the Fortnite map right now, straight from Epic's official map data.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 6.301
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty points on the map: thirteen big named locations, twenty landmarks, and seven Override Consoles.",
   "t0": 6.501,
   "t1": 12.444
  },
  {
   "text": "We'll go clockwise from the north. Save this one for your next drop.",
   "t0": 12.644,
   "t1": 16.047
  },
  {
   "text": "Part one: the thirteen named locations.",
   "t0": 16.448,
   "t1": 18.71
  },
  {
   "text": "First up, Freaky Fields, in the north of the island.",
   "t0": 19.01,
   "t1": 21.799
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, WonkeeLand, in the north-east of the island.",
   "t0": 22.049,
   "t1": 24.756
  },
  {
   "text": "Reality's Reign sits near the centre of the island.",
   "t0": 25.006,
   "t1": 27.594
  },
  {
   "text": "After that, Golden Grove, in the east of the island.",
   "t0": 27.844,
   "t1": 30.655
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Shaken Sanctuary, in the south-east of the island.",
   "t0": 30.905,
   "t1": 33.839
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep going and you hit Cluster Coast, on the far south-east edge of the island.",
   "t0": 34.089,
   "t1": 38.285
  },
  {
   "text": "Sunken Shores sits on the far south edge of the island.",
   "t0": 38.535,
   "t1": 41.463
  },
  {
   "text": "After that, Stone Sanctum, in the south-west of the island.",
   "t0": 41.713,
   "t1": 44.807
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Heatwave Harbor, on the far south-west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 45.057,
   "t1": 48.376
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep going and you hit Green Hill Zone, in the west of the island.",
   "t0": 48.626,
   "t1": 52.007
  },
  {
   "text": "Epic's Override news says the island now has areas inspired by gaming legends like Sonic, Tetris, and Pac-Man.",
   "t0": 52.257,
   "t1": 59.405
  },
  {
   "text": "Chopped Shop sits on the far north-west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 59.705,
   "t1": 62.641
  },
  {
   "text": "After that, Nightmare Neighborhood, in the north-west of the island.",
   "t0": 62.891,
   "t1": 66.208
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Lifty Lodge, on the far north-west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 66.458,
   "t1": 69.747
  },
  {
   "text": "Quick break: if you're buying anything today, use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel and keeps these videos coming.",
   "t0": 69.997,
   "t1": 77.343
  },
  {
   "text": "Part two: the landmarks. These are the smaller spots, and some of them are worth knowing.",
   "t0": 77.793,
   "t1": 82.182
  },
  {
   "text": "Stack o' Stones is in the north of the island.",
   "t0": 82.482,
   "t1": 84.781
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a Carwash in the south-east of the island,",
   "t0": 85.031,
   "t1": 87.276
  },
  {
   "text": "Pinky Island, on the far south-east edge of the island.",
   "t0": 87.526,
   "t1": 90.538
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, Pixel Polys, in the south of the island.",
   "t0": 90.788,
   "t1": 93.398
  },
  {
   "text": "Crashout Estates is on the far south edge of the island.",
   "t0": 93.648,
   "t1": 96.592
  },
  {
   "text": "Then there's Wettest-Bones Research Facility, in the south of the island.",
   "t0": 96.842,
   "t1": 100.355
  },
  {
   "text": "Mega Maze, in the south of the island.",
   "t0": 100.605,
   "t1": 102.666
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, Blinky Island, on the far south-west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 102.916,
   "t1": 106.448
  },
  {
   "text": "The Quackaway is on the far south-west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 106.698,
   "t1": 109.682
  },
  {
   "text": "Then there's Birder's Beach, on the far south-west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 109.932,
   "t1": 113.365
  },
  {
   "text": "Dark Cartridge, near the centre of the island.",
   "t0": 113.615,
   "t1": 116.009
  },
  {
   "text": "Epic says a cursed cartridge is spreading through the Island, corrupting everything it touches.",
   "t0": 116.259,
   "t1": 120.872
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, Barncade, in the south-west of the island.",
   "t0": 121.172,
   "t1": 123.766
  },
  {
   "text": "Dine 'n Docks is on the far west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 124.016,
   "t1": 126.879
  },
  {
   "text": "Then there's Geno's Machine, near the centre of the island.",
   "t0": 127.129,
   "t1": 130.113
  },
  {
   "text": "and yes, a second Carwash, on the far west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 130.363,
   "t1": 133.873
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, Artsy RVs, on the far west edge of the island.",
   "t0": 134.123,
   "t1": 137.416
  },
  {
   "text": "Ol' Stumpy is in the north-west of the island.",
   "t0": 137.666,
   "t1": 139.972
  },
  {
   "text": "Then there's Pac-Man Island, in the north of the island.",
   "t0": 140.222,
   "t1": 142.999
  },
  {
   "text": "Freddy Fazbear's Pizzeria, in the north of the island.",
   "t0": 143.249,
   "t1": 146.007
  },
  {
   "text": "Epic says one animatronic boss is always lurking at Freddy Fazbear's Pizza Parlor.",
   "t0": 146.257,
   "t1": 151.375
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, The Sleazy Snooze, on the far north edge of the island.",
   "t0": 151.675,
   "t1": 154.959
  },
  {
   "text": "And finally, part three: the seven Override Consoles.",
   "t0": 155.209,
   "t1": 158.39
  },
  {
   "text": "Console one, in the north of the island.",
   "t0": 158.59,
   "t1": 160.79
  },
  {
   "text": "Console two, in the north-east of the island.",
   "t0": 160.99,
   "t1": 163.403
  },
  {
   "text": "Console three, in the south-east of the island.",
   "t0": 163.603,
   "t1": 166.088
  },
  {
   "text": "Console four, in the south of the island.",
   "t0": 166.288,
   "t1": 168.557
  },
  {
   "text": "Console five, in the south-west of the island.",
   "t0": 168.757,
   "t1": 171.296
  },
  {
   "text": "Console six, in the west of the island.",
   "t0": 171.496,
   "t1": 173.675
  },
  {
   "text": "Console seven, in the north-west of the island.",
   "t0": 173.875,
   "t1": 176.411
  },
  {
   "text": "That's every named place on the map right now.",
   "t0": 176.611,
   "t1": 178.752
  },
  {
   "text": "Where are you dropping first? Tell me in the comments.",
   "t0": 178.952,
   "t1": 181.299
  },
  {
   "text": "And if this helped, use code BAD in the Item Shop. See you in the next one.",
   "t0": 181.549,
   "t1": 185.511
  }
 ],
